---
import settings from '../../public/models/saturn/scene.json';
import '../styles/saturn-exhibit.css';

const width = 960;
const unit = width / settings.camera.frameWidth;
const radians = settings.camera.openAngle * Math.PI / 180;
const opening = Math.sin(radians);
const globeHeight = unit * Math.hypot(settings.geometry.polarRadius * Math.cos(radians), opening);
const bands = [
  { radius: 1.38, width: .30, color: '#977d62', alpha: .55 },
  { radius: 1.74, width: .42, color: '#dbbc92', alpha: .82 },
  { radius: 2.145, width: .25, color: '#b69b78', alpha: .74 },
  { radius: 2.31, width: .02, color: '#d9b78b', alpha: .55 }
];
---
<section id="saturno-aneis" class="saturn-exhibit" data-saturn aria-labelledby="saturn-title">
  <h3 id="saturn-title">Por que os anéis quase desaparecem quando vistos de perfil?</h3>
  <div class="saturn-controls" data-saturn-controls>
    <div class="saturn-control-label">
      <label for="saturn-angle">Ângulo de visão</label>
      <output for="saturn-angle" data-saturn-angle aria-live="off">{settings.camera.openAngle}°</output>
    </div>
    <input id="saturn-angle" type="range" min="0" max="90" step="1" value={settings.camera.openAngle}
      aria-describedby="saturn-explanation" data-saturn-slider disabled />
    <div class="saturn-presets" role="group" aria-label="Posições da câmera">
      <button type="button" data-saturn-preset={settings.camera.openAngle} aria-pressed="true" disabled>Vista aberta</button>
      <button type="button" data-saturn-preset={settings.camera.edgeAngle} aria-pressed="false" disabled>De perfil</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="saturn-stage" data-saturn-stage aria-hidden="true">
    <svg data-saturn-diagram viewBox="0 0 960 540" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <defs>
        <radialGradient id="saturn-disc" cx="37%" cy="35%" r="67%">
          <stop stop-color="#f0dab4" /><stop offset=".67" stop-color="#baa17d" /><stop offset="1" stop-color="#514439" />
        </radialGradient>
        <clipPath id="saturn-rings-front"><path d="M0 270H960V540H0Z" /></clipPath>
        <clipPath id="saturn-disc-clip"><ellipse cx="480" cy="270" rx={unit} ry={globeHeight} data-saturn-globe /></clipPath>
      </defs>
      <g transform="translate(480 270)">
        <g data-saturn-rings transform={`scale(1 ${opening})`}>
          {bands.map(({ radius, width, color, alpha }) => <circle r={radius * unit} fill="none" stroke={color} stroke-width={width * unit} opacity={alpha} />)}
        </g>
      </g>
      <ellipse cx="480" cy="270" rx={unit} ry={globeHeight} fill="url(#saturn-disc)" stroke="#e5c798" stroke-opacity=".6" stroke-width="2" data-saturn-globe />
      <g clip-path="url(#saturn-disc-clip)" fill="none">
        <path d="M270 175Q480 252 690 175M270 230Q480 305 690 230M270 328Q480 390 690 328" stroke="#7c6146" stroke-width="10" opacity=".21" />
        <path d="M270 220Q480 295 690 220M270 285Q480 355 690 285" stroke="#ffe0a7" stroke-width="8" opacity=".27" />
      </g>
      <g clip-path="url(#saturn-rings-front)">
        <g transform="translate(480 270)">
          <g data-saturn-rings transform={`scale(1 ${opening})`}>
            {bands.map(({ radius, width, color, alpha }) => <circle r={radius * unit} fill="none" stroke={color} stroke-width={width * unit} opacity={alpha} />)}
          </g>
        </g>
      </g>
      <path data-saturn-edge d="M63 270H301M659 270H897" stroke="#bc9a73" stroke-width="1.4" visibility="hidden" />
    </svg>
  </div>
  <noscript><style>.saturn-exhibit .saturn-controls { display: none; }</style></noscript>
  <p id="saturn-explanation">Quando a câmera chega ao plano dos anéis, vemos só sua borda. Os anéis são muito finos em relação à largura, então quase desaparecem. A posição do Sol fica fixa.</p>
  <details class="depth-detail saturn-credits">
    <summary>Créditos e limites da ilustração</summary>
    <p>Mapa ilustrativo de JPL/Caltech, disponibilizado pela NASA. Faixas e transparência dos anéis foram modeladas pelo Cosmos do Zero. Cores, brilho e largura aparente da atmosfera têm ajuste artístico. No diagrama de perfil, a borda dos anéis é ampliada para ficar legível.</p>
    <p><a href="https://science.nasa.gov/3d-resources/saturn/">Mapa para modelos 3D · NASA</a> · <a href="https://science.nasa.gov/missions/hubble/hubble-views-saturn-ring-plane-crossing/">Anéis vistos de perfil · Hubble/NASA</a></p>
  </details>
</section>

<script>
  import { initSaturn } from '../scripts/saturn-exhibit';
  initSaturn();
</script>
